      "title": "A little more about this corner.",
      "intro": "Hi, I’m frostmoon-rui. This is a place for technical experiments, useful notes, and good food.",
      "sections": [
        {
          "title": "Things I work on",
          "text": "Python and asynchronous bots, Arduino and STM32 projects, and the meeting point between hardware and software."
        },
        {
          "title": "What lives here",
          "text": "Project notes, recovered technical archives, and a public food atlas with sources kept close to each recommendation."
        },
        {
          "title": "A note left open",
          "text": "A more personal introduction will come later. For now, you can explore the projects or say hello through the links below."
        }
      ]
    },
